  "content": "<h3><strong>採集等級調整器</strong></h3><h5>一款Minecraft forge模組，讓模組包製作者能自訂採集等級名稱與顏色。<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/629/261/image_20230303203655.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"211\" height=\"60\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/629/260/screenshot-2023-03-03-203527.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"219\" height=\"38\"></h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p>目前支援：</p><ul>\n<li>The One Probe</li>\n<li>Jade</li>\n<li>WTHIT</li>\n<li>匠魂模組<br><br></li>\n</ul><p>需要協助？加入我的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/FFAdyuqNvm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord伺服器</a>！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>詳細說明與教學請見GitHub：<a href=\"https://github.com/yzl210/HarvestLevelTweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/yzl210/HarvestLevelTweaker</a></p>",
